	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d26r0101_boss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ポケモンしょうぶ　とは
ポケモンを　きずつけること……▼
そうとらえ　きらっていたが
そんな　たんじゅんな　ものでは　ない[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:19:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:05:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ポケモン勝負　とは
ポケモンを　傷つけること……▼
そうとらえ　忌避していたが
そんな　単純な　ものでは　ない[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:19:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:05:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、首フリアニメ
・主人公に近づいて
・続けてboss_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:05:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:05:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T10:46:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
